cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "DSPG Synthesis and Analysis: Empirical Evaluation"
abstract: >
  Empirical evaluation code for comparing two DSPG (Dispersed Series-Parallel
  Graph) synthesis strategies in the context of Subjective Logic trust network
  analysis. Implements Jøsang's original criteria and an optimized criterion,
  with benchmarking across randomly generated trust networks.
